&& bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n            <b>Our Founder &amp; Managing Director</b></h3>\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/ash-headshot-1-1076x1267.webp\" alt=\"Ash Dowie\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-4' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth >= 6, 'col-lg-6' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth <= 5}\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Ash prides himself on being recognised by his clients &amp; peers as an experienced financial advisor.<br><br>With over 25 years of experience as a financial adviser, Ash has been recognised as a leader in his profession, having won multiple awards. His high technical expertise and unique ability to communicate with clients (making the complex simple) are why he has attracted and retained loyal clients over his many years in the industry.<br><br>As a partner of a company with more than 150 employees, Ash became increasingly aware of losing connection with his clients. Taking pride in sharing his knowledge and commitment to providing exceptional client experiences, Ash committed himself to serving with a more personalised approach, leading to the establishment of Fiorente Advisory with office hubs in Melbourne, the Sunshine Coast, and Townsville.<br><br>What is the significance of the word “Fiorente”? It is an Italian adjective for “flourishing and thriving”. This simple word describes my desire for my company as well as the financial position of my clients.<br><br>“My focus as a Financial Advisor is educating and assisting clients to make the best decisions in building and protecting their wealth to ensure they have the income they desire to live their best life.”<br><br>If you would like to understand the benefits of having an experienced Financial Advisor provide you with financial peace of mind, <a href=\"tel:+61-7-5318-7271\" class=\"text-secondary\"><b>contact</b></a> Ash today for a consultation.</p>\n                    <p class=\"name mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-if=\"showName\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".name\"><b>\n                        Ash Dowie | Managing Director &amp;&nbsp;</b>Private Client Advisor<br><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-info\">Authorised Representative Number  299533</a><br><a href=\"tel:+61-488-025-075\" class=\"text-secondary\">0488 025 075</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:ash@fiorenteadvisory.com.au\" class=\"text-secondary\">ash@fiorenteadvisory.com.au</a><br></p>\n                    <p class=\"position mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showPosition\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".position\"></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
