chelor of Commerce (Accounting) and an Advanced Diploma (Financial Planning).<br><br>In 2022, he joined the Fiorente Advisory team as a Senior Financial Adviser, having previously worked in the Big 4 banks, a stockbroking firm, and a private practice. Tim prides himself on explaining strategies in a way that is easy to understand and, as a result, builds a strong rapport with his clients.<br><br>Away from the office, Tim loves spending time with his young family and surfing at Alexandra Headland.</p>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubitle\"><b>Senior Financial Planner</b><br><b><a href=\"tel:+61-436-624-201\" class=\"text-secondary\">0436 624 201</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:tim@fiorenteadvisory.com.au\" class=\"text-secondary\">tim@fiorenteadvisory.com.au</a></b></h3>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
