tyle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\">With over 15 years of experience, we have honed our approach to investment management, resulting in an investment portfolio that consistently performs.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"items > 1\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-smile-face mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\"><b>Results that speak for themselves</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\">Our results show that client portfolios continue to perform well in various market conditions over both the short and long term. We attribute this robust performance to our personalised investment process and active portfolio management.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"items > 2\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-users mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\"><b>Personally managed investment accounts</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\">With personally managed accounts, investments are owned directly by you, the client. Personally managing accounts provides you with greater flexibility and control.</h5>\n                    </div>\